0 a second of tone played, and was recorded where the board has a microphone
2 2 is speaker.initialize: the codec did not answer, or the board has no speaker
3 3 is microphone.initialize, which answered neither Ok nor Unsupported
4 4 is speaker.configure: the transport or the rate was refused
5 5 is microphone.configure
6 6 is the speaker's Ring
7 7 is the microphone's Ring
8 8 is microphone.start
9 9 is speaker.start
10 10 is speaker.service
11 11 is microphone.service
12 12 is speaker.position
13 13 is speaker.stop
14 14 is microphone.stop
